                                "elements": "Rational numbers are represented by fraction. They are entered using the division symbol (the \"/\" key), or by selecting this symbol in the math panel. The integer part of the fraction, if any, can be entered ",
                                "format_id": "3693af25-cacf-4d9f-a08d-684117ed881e"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
